{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the ruined Taurus II Colony Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through an interconnected world and uncover long forgotten memories buried beneath an eternity of dust and death. Hunt the spectres threatening existence itself, or destroy the order holding them back. Whether snaking through narrow hallways or exploring large open spaces, your sense of direction will be put to the test every step along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/4c6952a07cd05cc94fdb630fad00e89d.poster.avif?t=1770849374\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/4c6952a07cd05cc94fdb630fad00e89d.webm?t=1770849374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/4c6952a07cd05cc94fdb630fad00e89d.mp4?t=1770849374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat imposing foes in action packed dogfights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through enemy attacks, outsmart and overwhelm their systems, and take down challenging bosses in a light show of fiery explosions and vibrant projectiles. Optimize your loadout and overpower your enemy or perfect your positioning, timing and awareness so that none will be able to touch you, but be warned: your adversaries will do the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/5561fba04e6465e3a39ed5020a542355.poster.avif?t=1770849374\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/5561fba04e6465e3a39ed5020a542355.webm?t=1770849374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/5561fba04e6465e3a39ed5020a542355.mp4?t=1770849374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find powerful equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your offensive and defensive arsenal from many different weapons, modules and ships. Select the best tools for the challenges you face, or overcome them with sheer determination. Choose your vessel, equip weapons from 10+ different classes, support with modules and consumables and engulf your opponents in a storm of bullets, missiles, lasers and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/ef396c7844ca7b8d14c7df6312fbd36e.poster.avif?t=1770849374\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/ef396c7844ca7b8d14c7df6312fbd36e.webm?t=1770849374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/extras/ef396c7844ca7b8d14c7df6312fbd36e.mp4?t=1770849374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794790?t=1770849374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/30f8ee88897925dd0d0d37e6559d7dfd9dde6d33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770849374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794790/429aa441cca3cdf7f885efe212ecf10caadd0e3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770849374","capsule_imagev5":"http